--
N5008 [temp.inst]/4, [temp.point]/1: a cvise-reduced, header-free model of the
libstdc++ std::get<0> chain (std::get -> std::__get_helper ->
_Tuple_impl::_M_head); returns 42 under a conforming compiler (verified g++).

The deferred __get_helper<0> body now resolves: its non-deduced trailing
parameter pack _Tail is correctly empty, so the body qualifier
_Tuple_impl<__i, int, _Tail...> collapses to _Tuple_impl<__i, int> and the
inherited _M_head is found.  Non-vacuous: assertion 1 SUCCEEDs and assertion 2
(a wrong value) FAILs.
